Your mucus is brought to near sentience.

Each turn, a random spot of your mucus will spawn a Mucus Ooze with a chance of {{cl|{{ctmd|5|300}}|50%|12.6|26|32%|220}}.

Mucus Oozes last {{cts|6|10}} turns and will attack any of your foes by spitting slime at them.

You may have up to {{css|Cun|0.5|5}} Mucus Oozes active at any time (based on your Cunning).

Any time you deal a mental critical, the remaining time on all of your Mucus Oozes will increase by 2.

The spawn chance increases with your Mindpower.
